  "text": "[NLFC.2.2] `ds_engine_pump` takes the engine and nothing else, and runs the\nagenda to exhaustion — every activation that can fire, fires — before it\nreturns. No argument bounds the work one pump does. A pump is an in-process call\non the integrator's own stack ([IARC.1.10]), so nothing outside it can stop it\npart-way.\n\n",
